---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Contact from '../components/Contact.astro';
import { profile, experience, expertise } from '../data/profile';
---
<Base title="About Rahul Negi — Software Engineer & Systems Builder" description="Meet Rahul Negi: software engineer with experience at Razorpay and Amazon, focused on backend systems, payments, reliability, and thoughtful delivery.">
<section class="container page-intro about-intro"><p class="eyebrow accent">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</p><h1>Curious by default.<br/><span>Deliberate by design.</span></h1><div class="about-summary"><div><p class="about-lead">I’m Rahul. I build systems that are easier to trust, operate, and evolve.</p><p>{profile.introduction}</p><p>I care about clear service boundaries, backward-compatible changes, and the operational details that turn working code into a dependable system. I also work across React, TypeScript, and cloud delivery when the problem calls for it.</p><a class="button outline" href="/resume.pdf" download="Rahul-Negi-Resume.pdf">Download my resume <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="about-principles"><p class="eyebrow muted">A FEW WORKING PRINCIPLES</p><ol><li>Make the failure mode explicit.</li><li>Measure before making the claim.</li><li>Prefer clear boundaries.</li><li>Leave a system easier to understand.</li></ol></div></div></section>
<section class="section container about-experience"><p class="eyebrow accent">EXPERIENCE / THE LONGER STORY</p><h2>Engineering with consequences.</h2><div class="timeline">{experience.map(e=><article><div><p class="mono muted">{e.period}</p><h3>{e.company}</h3><p class="muted">{e.location}</p></div><div><h4>{e.role}</h4><p>{e.description}</p><ul>{e.details.map(d=><li>{d}</li>)}</ul></div></article>)}</div><p class="small muted">Employment details are based on the supplied resume. “Joined July 2024” records a start date without asserting current employment.</p></section>
<section class="section container about-skills"><p class="eyebrow accent">TOOLS / CHOSEN FOR THE PROBLEM</p><h2>A practical toolkit.</h2><div class="expertise-grid">{expertise.map(e=><article class="expertise-item"><h3>{e.title}</h3><ul class="skill-list">{e.skills.map(skill=><li>{skill}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="container education"><p class="eyebrow accent">FOUNDATIONS</p><div><h2>B.Tech, Computer Science</h2><p>ADGITM (NIEC), Delhi · 2018–2022 · GPA 9.2/10</p><p class="muted">Operating systems, algorithms, networking, and databases.</p></div></section><Contact/>
</Base>
